# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build outputs (regenerated by gpsimd-build / bench.py / run_examples.sh).
# nkiopt/cases/*/build* alone is ~88 GB (staged .npy inputs, NEFFs, profiles).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
build_*/
out/
nkiopt/cases/*/data/

# Compiled artifacts
*.neff
*.ntff
*.so
*.o
*.a
*.nm
*.elf
tools/xslot

# Arrays / tensors staged for runs
*.npy
*.npz

# Run logs and program output
*.log
logs/
*.out

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party checkouts (nested git repos; clone them separately)
#   ext/vllm-neuron      https://github.com/OswaldHe/vllm-neuron (deepseek_v41_trn3)
#   re/neuron-neff-doc
# The DeepSeek cases carry verbatim copies of the few helper modules they use
# (nkiopt/cases/ds41_*/ds41?/, Apache-2.0, origin commit in ds41k/SOURCE).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ext/
re/neuron-neff-doc/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Material extracted from the AWS Neuron SDK / device (firmware dumps,
# runtime disassembly, SDK ELFs and NEFFs). Proprietary, and nrt.dis exceeds
# GitHub's 100 MB file limit; regenerate locally with the tools/ scripts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
re/fw/
re/*.bin
re/*.dis

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
